            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3001",
            "content": {
                "en": "No!",
                "zh": "不！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 687.0,
            "positionY": 721.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3a8587d0-4fde-4baf-8a5a-e93c1b7ba1db",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3002",
            "content": {
                "en": "What? I'm... back here again?",
                "zh": "什么？我又......回到了这里？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1026.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2ab92309-2bfc-4f88-a564-e2b0f3c7f789",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3003",
            "content": {
                "en": "The lights are on, and everyone else seems normal.",
                "zh": "灯光亮着，其他人看上去也很正常。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1379.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6b724af7-8bf3-463e-8446-6d79cc6a90a9",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3004",
            "content": {
                "en": "Just like the last two times. <color=red>So every time I die... I return to this moment?</color>",
                "zh": "和前两次一样。<color=red>只要我死去......就会回到这个时间点？</color>",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1739.0,
            "positionY": 722.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7ffd9d99-d58a-4f45-8d87-220ac531757e",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3005",
            "content": {
                "en": "Calm down. There must be a way off this plane.",
                "zh": "冷静下来，一定有办法能离开这趟飞机。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2120.0,
            "positionY": 728.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "584519ca-ca54-450d-8832-8c9043de17b5",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3006",
            "content": {
                "en": "Before Page disappeared, that mirror in her hand gave off a white light.",
                "zh": "周书消失之前，她手里的那面镜子发出了白光。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2497.0,
            "positionY": 726.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
